<title>MALAYSIA: SMPC Metal year net up sharply.</title>
<headline>SMPC Metal year net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan. 31, 1997</p>
<p>			 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   10.61	  vs	  5.36</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  53.0	   vs	 30.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		    236.01	  vs	157.44</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     13.33	  vs	 11.20</p>
<p>    Minorities		   nil	    vs less   1.81</p>
<p>NOTE - SMPC Metal Industries Bhd is involved in letting of industrial, commercial assets as well as metal sheet and coil processing.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
</text>
